WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers...

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.541
Players stop being polite...

00:00:07.541 --> 00:00:09.666
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:10.666
This is...

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.958
The Champions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000
I'm De Jong! 

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.875
But I'm De Youngest!

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:16.333
You’ve got to fight-

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:17.416
For your right-

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:19.916
To Thoooomassss!

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:22.416
Let me talk! Let me talk!

00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:23.666
OK...talk.

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:24.958
Kevin.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.958
The Special One is back, haha!

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:28.875
Hope the Premier League is ready for more...

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.250
...inho!

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:45.583
C’mon, Neymar. We're watching!

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:47.166
Oh, hey, movie night? Dope!

00:00:47.166 --> 00:00:49.250
Is this, like, an artsy French film or something?

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.041
Uh. It’s match film.

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:52.708
Oh, nice. I love football movies!

00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:53.958
Check this one out.

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:04.041
What the hell?

00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:06.041
Ever since the Barca transfer fell through,

00:01:06.041 --> 00:01:08.750
I've been sensing some weird vibes from my PSG teammates.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.541
And honestly, I don’t get it.

00:01:10.541 --> 00:01:12.958
I’m scoring sick goals, I got mad tekkers,

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.416
and I’ve got over a 100 million IG followers.

00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:17.458
Like, what else do I gotta do to be liked?!

00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:18.125
It's ridiculous, man.

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:18.875
You're so dope.

00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:20.125
How could anyone not like you?

00:01:26.125 --> 00:01:26.916
Surprise!

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:27.666
Zut alors!

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.291
What the hell?!

00:01:29.291 --> 00:01:31.416
I wanted to throw you all a surprise party, you know,

00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:33.750
to show how much I don’t hate playing with y'all in France.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.041
We can't party. We have a match tomorrow.

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:37.541
OK, never stopped me before.

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:41.125
It took my people all day to set up that party.

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:45.166
I mean, I perpetuated every French stereotype I could think of...

00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:46.166
all for nothing.

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:47.166
Ridiculous!

00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:48.166
I worked an hour on that.

00:01:48.166 --> 00:01:51.291
I used all my printer ink on that picture of Jean-Paul Belmondo.

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.833
Maybe we should have gone with the farming theme.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.791
Neymar, we know you don’t want to be here.

00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:58.250
That’s ridiculous, man.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:02.541
You guys are like brothers to me, and believe me, I really love my siblings.

00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:05.791
OK, then why did you offer to pay €20 million

00:02:05.791 --> 00:02:07.791
to cover the transfer fees to Barcelona?

00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:10.000
Uh...to save you guys money!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.458
Pffft! Wow. You guys are, like, really ungrateful.

00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:13.625
Are you being serious?

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:15.000
Have you even thanked me once

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.416
for taking all of the penalties for you over the past two years?

00:02:17.416 --> 00:02:19.750
I want to take the penalties!

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:23.916
See, this is the thing, you are only worried about what Neymar wants.

00:02:23.916 --> 00:02:25.250
You don’t care about the team.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.000
Oh yeah? I love Paris Saint-Germany.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.708
In fact, I love PSG so much,

00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:34.625
that I got a giant PSG tattoo on my back!

00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:37.833
You got a giant PSG tattoo on your back?

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:38.875
Yeah, bro!

00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:39.875
Can we see it?

00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:43.500
Uh…well, I mean, it’s like brand-new, so,

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.791
you know the doctor said it might get infected, so...

00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:48.541
you know, I gotta keep it covered, but, uh...

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:50.541
Show us this tattoo, Neymar.

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:52.125
OK! Fine. You guys want to see it?

00:02:52.125 --> 00:02:54.208
No problemo. I just need to...um...

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:56.500
just need to, uh, get this shirt off,

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.541
because it could be...it’s a bit complicated.

00:02:58.541 --> 00:03:00.250
Show us the tattoo! Just show us the tattoo!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.708
OK, OK! Fine, fine! Chill, Cavani.

00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:05.791
OK, ready. Um...check this out.

00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:07.416
What the hell is that?

00:03:07.416 --> 00:03:09.166
This is a new low, Neymar.

00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:13.541
OK. You know what. You guys are meaner than the PSG ultras, man!

00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:15.583
I'm leaving! You don't deserve me!

00:03:15.583 --> 00:03:17.416
I thought that tattoo was pretty dope.

00:03:17.416 --> 00:03:18.958
Yeah, that artwork was sick.

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:19.958
I love my GPS, man.

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:21.125
That's how I know where I am.

00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:23.583
Ugh. Everyone on PSG is, like, so judgmental.

00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:25.750
I need to go somewhere where I can clear my head.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.583
Yeah, we should go somewhere you can clear your head.

00:03:27.583 --> 00:03:28.291
That's a good idea.

00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:28.958
Yeah, like Ibiza!

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:32.750
I just don't get it.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.750
What happened to the days when all people cared about 

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.208
was flair and cool moves?

00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:37.208
I care about your flair.

00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:37.958
I love your tekkers.

00:03:37.958 --> 00:03:38.166
Yeah!

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:40.750
It feels like all anyone cares about these days is, like...

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.500
dedication and loyalty and, like, sacrifice...you know.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.791
That corny s--t.

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:45.791
Times are changing, man.

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:46.625
I’m just here for the money.

00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:49.541
Hey, man. Are you OK?

00:03:49.541 --> 00:03:51.833
Oh, great. Here comes the new guy.

00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:55.041
I just want you to know that I don’t think you are a jerk.

00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:56.416
You don't?

00:03:56.416 --> 00:03:59.666
I think that you are just following your heart. Trying to be happy.

00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:02.333
I walked the same path as you. I lost many friends.

00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:04.125
You did?

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.625
When I was a young player in Sampdoria,

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.375
I met this beautiful woman.

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:10.250
A mother of three.

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.666
She was smart, sassy...but she was also sad.

00:04:13.666 --> 00:04:17.875
You see, her husband was always away, doing...

00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:18.833
who knows what.

00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:24.125
Well, long story short, I fell in love with her and made her my wife.

00:04:24.125 --> 00:04:26.958
And I even got her children's names tattooed on my arm.

00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:30.333
That’s beautiful. And people think you’re a jerk for this?

00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:33.625
People are set in their ways. Just look out for you.

00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:35.458
Be really good at football,

00:04:35.458 --> 00:04:39.791
and people will either forgive you or, if not, they will transfer you.

00:04:39.791 --> 00:04:41.083
Thank you, Mauro.

00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:44.000
I think this is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.291
I would like that. Tell me about your family.

00:04:47.291 --> 00:04:50.458
Well, I'm very close to them. In fact, my dad is my agent.

00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:53.708
Oh, no way?! My wife is my agent! Do you have a wife?

00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:57.375
Oh no, actually, but I have a beautiful sister whom I'm very close with.

00:04:57.375 --> 00:04:59.125
Really? I would love to meet her.

00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:01.791
Maybe we can all take a yacht trip together someday?

00:05:01.791 --> 00:05:03.416
Yo! That would be dope!

00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:04.416
So dope!

00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:05.416
I love yachts, man!

00:05:05.416 --> 00:05:07.291
Maybe he'll get a tattoo of us some day.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.000
Check out "Your Call"

00:05:12.166 --> 00:05:14.375
BR Football's new interactive adventure that's

00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:15.958
so realistic you can even...

00:05:15.958 --> 00:05:17.916
fight your teammate in training.

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:20.333
Pfft! Like that would ever happen.

